## Change Summary

**Line 106-113** in `handleEntryClick()`:
- Changed from checking `if (!entry.is_dir)` then `openFile()`
- Now calls `this.openEntry(entry)` which:
  - Navigates to directory if `entry.is_dir === true`
  - Opens file if `entry.is_dir === false`

This reuses the existing `openEntry()` method which already handles both cases correctly.
